{
  "$comment": "Machine-readable map of NVX Stack Builder for AI agents. Verified by `npm run docs:check` (templateIds must equal src/data/template-ids.ts; every keyFiles path must exist). Human docs: docs/agents/AGENT-PLAYBOOK.md",
